" end="00:56.481"><span begin="00:54.604" end="00:54.860">I </span><span begin="00:54.860" end="00:55.046">might </span><span begin="00:55.046" end="00:55.230">have </span><span begin="00:55.230" end="00:55.482">to </span><span begin="00:55.482" end="00:55.669">bend </span><span begin="00:55.669" end="00:55.857">it </span><span begin="00:55.857" end="00:56.481">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.481" end="00:57.983"><span begin="00:56.481" end="00:56.670">Or </span><span begin="00:56.670" end="00:56.858">break </span><span begin="00:56.858" end="00:57.044">it  </span><span begin="00:57.044" end="00:57.230">break </span><span begin="00:57.230" end="00:57.418">it </span><span begin="00:57.418" end="00:57.983">off</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.046" end="01:02.297"><span begin="01:01.046" end="01:01.356">Next </span><span begin="01:01.356" end="01:01.544">time </span><span begin="01:01.544" end="01:01.670">you </span><span begin="01:01.670" end="01:01.858">point </span><span begin="01:01.858" end="01:01.984">a </span><span begin="01:01.984" end="01:02.297">finger</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.297" end="01:04.294"><span begin="01:02.297" end="01:02.482">I'll </span><span begin="01:02.482" end="01:02.610">point </span><span begin="01:02.610" end="01:02.794">you </span><span begin="01:02.794" end="01:02.980">to </span><span begin="01:02.980" end="01:03.170">the </span><span begin="01:03.170" end="01:04.294">mirror</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.200" end="01:13.452"><span begin="01:10.200" end="01:10.454">If </span><span begin="01:10.454" end="01:10.700">God's </span><span begin="01:10.700" end="01:10.954">the </span><span begin="01:10.954" end="01:11.202">game </span><span begin="01:11.202" end="01:11.450">that </span><span begin="01:11.450" end="01:11.826">you're </span><span begin="01:11.826" end="01:13.452">playing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.452" end="01:16.455"><span begin="01:13.452" end="01:13.637">Well  </span